{"id":"6641b33d894aa637","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-initial-condition.md","title":"Initial Condition","display":"df-initial-condition — Initial Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-initial-condition","aliases":["58-df-initial-condition"],"display":"df-initial-condition — Initial Condition","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-initial-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-initial-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-initial-condition — Initial Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,X,u,t_0,x_0\\in V\">\\(T,X,u,t_0,x_0\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(u,T,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(u,T,X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}initial\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S(u,T,X,t_0,x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(u,T,X)\\land t_0\\in T\\land x_0\\in X\\land u(t_0)=x_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}initial\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S(u,T,X,t_0,x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(u,T,X)\\land t_0\\in T\\land x_0\\in X\\land u(t_0)=x_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This predicate records only the value constraint <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(t_0)=x_0\">\\(u(t_0)=x_0\\)</span>; satisfying a differential equation is a separate condition on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(u,T,X)$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,X,u,t_0,x_0\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(u,T,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}initial\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S(u,T,X,t_0,x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(u,T,X)\\land t_0\\in T\\land x_0\\in X\\land u(t_0)=x_0","display":true},{"tex":"u(t_0)=x_0","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false}],"bytes":753,"backlinks":[{"id":"31710fa05b4ffe92","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S$ (initial-value predicate, see [[58-df-initial-condition]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-682","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-initial-condition.md|58-df-initial-condition]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d21